    <moqui.math.ParameterDef parameterDefId="PD_CONCENTRATION_B_IN" parameterTypeEnumId="PtNumberDecimal" purposeEnumId="PpFeedback" parameterCode="SIG.001" parameterName="ConcentrationBIn" description="Physical AI from the C_B composition analyzer. Renders as dev.concentrationControllerConcentrationBIn. Wired manually in InputSignalUpdate (field-engineer-owned). The same manual step also copies this raw value into dev.concentrationControllerFeedback (the ProcessPid instance's feedback input) since that wiring is genuinely site-specific. Instrument span (0-2 gmol/liter) is an assumption giving headroom above the ~1.266 gmol/liter theoretical maximum; confirm against the real analyzer's calibrated range." />
