    <moqui.math.Parameter parameterId="P_RUN_CMD" parameterDefId="PD_RUN_CMD" deviceId="REACTOR_CC" symbolicValue="N" />
    <moqui.math.ParameterDef parameterDefId="PD_CONCENTRATION_B_HIGH_THRESHOLD" parameterTypeEnumId="PtNumberDecimal" purposeEnumId="PpFeedback" parameterCode="SIG.004" parameterName="ConcentrationBHighThreshold" description="Not a physical signal; same documented tooling-gap workaround as tank-level-control-001's threshold parameters (see moqui-device-seed-designer/references/free-standing-parameters.md). Renders as dev.concentrationControllerConcentrationBHighThreshold. Developer-confirmed tuned value 1.2 gmol/liter, set via device-config-survey.yaml, a safety margin below the source material's ~1.266 gmol/liter theoretical maximum (the input-multiplicity zero-process-gain point)." />
